      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-46924",
      ":question/problem": "Susan carries out a survey of $300$ students to determine their favorite sports. The table below shows the results of her survey.\n\n| Favorite sport | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Baseball | $45$ |\n| Soccer | $108$ |\n| Volleyball | $25$ |\n| Basketball | $81$ |\n| Swimming | $41$ |\n\nBased on this information, what is the experimental probability that a student's favorite sport is basketball?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
    }
